{"title": "Signed Trade Visa", "pageid": 9095, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Signed_Trade_Visa", "categories": ["Scrolls", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png/300px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/2/21/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Signed Trade Visa image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png/300px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Signed Trade Visa</span></a> is a very rare variant of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unsigned_Trade_Visa\" title=\"Unsigned Trade Visa\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unsigned_Trade_Visa\" title=\"Unsigned Trade Visa\">Unsigned Trade Visa</a>. It can be used to cast Flesh to Gold.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A visa promising safe passage to Baldur's Gate, stamped with the letters 'GT'.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/37px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/49px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scrolls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">Scrolls</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Gerringothe Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gerringothe Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/2