s=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f2c940ba-3049-49d2-bb90-af9f4830057c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f2c940ba-3049-49d2-bb90-af9f4830057c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_TWN_Scroll_FleshToGold</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_TWN_Scroll_FleshToGold+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_TWN_Scroll_FleshToGold+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Consume the scroll to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_to_Gold\" title=\"Flesh to Gold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/25px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/38px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/50px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flesh to Gold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/25px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_to_Gold\" title=\"Flesh to Gold\">Flesh to Gold</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Obtained from Gerringothe Thorm in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\">Reithwin Tollhouse</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This scroll can only be acquired through dialogue, in exchange for the entirety of the party's gold; provided it is at least <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/23px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/35px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/46px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"5000 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/23px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 5000 gp.</li>\n<li>This scroll cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribed</a> into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wizard's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard's</a> spellbook.</li>\n<li>Unlike other scrolls, the description for Flesh to Gold is not displayed on this item.  Additionally, the right-click context menu states \"Read\" instead of \"Cast spell\".</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195046\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2930/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45379/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11925/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1034550/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.255      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   67.255      1 -total\n 47.55%   31.978     12 Template:Icon_text\n 43.46%   29.231     34 Template:Trim\n 29.68%   19.964      1 Template:PageSeo\n 29.58%   19.893      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 20.26%   13.629      1 Template:RarityItem\n 19.49%   13.109      1 Template:Item_icon\n 18.03%   12.129      3 Template:Uid\n 17.13%   11.519     14 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9095-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195046 and revision id 375386. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}